{"seq":4,"slug":"decumulation-phase","title":"消耗期策略","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/retirement-planning/decumulation-phase","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"withdrawal-rules","title":"提取规则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/retirement-planning/decumulation-phase/withdrawal-rules","wordCount":2370,"readingTime":10},{"seq":2,"slug":"bucket-strategy","title":"桶策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/retirement-planning/decumulation-phase/bucket-strategy","wordCount":2694,"readingTime":11},{"seq":3,"slug":"healthcare-costs","title":"医疗与长期照护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/retirement-planning/decumulation-phase/healthcare-costs","wordCount":3117,"readingTime":13}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"消耗期策略\">消耗期策略</h1><p>消耗期（Decumulation Phase）是退休后将积累的资产转化为可持续收入的阶段。与积累期&quot;如何存钱&quot;的问题相反，消耗期的核心问题是&quot;如何花钱才不会花光&quot;。</p>\n<p>这看似简单，实则比积累期更复杂。积累期只需考虑一个方向（存入），而消耗期需要同时管理提取、投资、通胀、税务、医疗支出和长寿风险等多重变量。一个不慎，可能在 80 岁时面临资金枯竭；过于保守，则在最活跃的退休初期生活质量不必要地受限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章内容\">本章内容</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>核心内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>提取规则</td>\n<td>4% 规则中国化、动态提取、生命周期理论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>桶策略</td>\n<td>三桶设计、现金流匹配、再填充时机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>医疗与长期照护</td>\n<td>退休后医疗支出、商业保险、中国医保政策</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"消耗期的核心挑战\">消耗期的核心挑战</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[消耗期核心挑战] --&gt; B[花多少?&lt;br/&gt;提取规则]&#10;    A --&gt; C[从哪花?&lt;br/&gt;桶策略]&#10;    A --&gt; D[意外怎么办?&lt;br/&gt;医疗照护规划]&#10;\">graph TD\n    A[消耗期核心挑战] --&gt; B[花多少?&lt;br/&gt;提取规则]\n    A --&gt; C[从哪花?&lt;br/&gt;桶策略]\n    A --&gt; D[意外怎么办?&lt;br/&gt;医疗照护规划]\n</pre>"}